# Playwright / E2E run artefacts. Screenshots, traces and videos are evidence for
# one run against one database state — they are stale the moment they are written,
# and they are large. The QA *report* gets committed; the pixels never do.
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
playwright/.cache/
**/*.webm
**/trace.zip

# Stray screenshot dumps at repo root. The named one-off rules that used to
# sit here were deleted along with the files they hid (2026-09-09); this
# pattern is what stops the next `browser_take_screenshot` from landing in the
# tree. Deliberate images belong in assets/ or design/.
/*.png

# Deployed artefacts and secrets that exist only on the server. Tracked here
# so a `git reset --hard` during deploy cannot remove them.
# Expo web export, built on the server by `expo export` and served by Caddy
field/
# generated owner password, lives only on the droplet
.admin-credential

# Local explainers / scratch work — never committed
scratch/

# Shared working file between agents (see AGENT_HANDOFF.md's own header).
# A conversation, not a record: anything durable belongs in docs/ or
# .claude/rules/ instead.
AGENT_HANDOFF.md
